        <div class="stat-ref"><span class="stat-letter">Typ</span><div><strong>Type</strong> — Assault, Grenade, Heavy, Melee, Pistol or Rapid Fire. Ranged weapons only shoot and Melee weapons only fight, unless stated otherwise.</div></div>
        <div class="stat-ref"><span class="stat-letter">S</span><div><strong>Strength</strong> — 1–10, or <strong>D</strong> for a Destroyer weapon. <strong>U</strong> means the wielder's own Strength; a modifier (“+1”, “x2”) applies to it.</div></div>
